WEBVTT

00:02:59.634 --> 00:03:01.636
To empower many more to lead,

00:03:01.677 --> 00:03:05.640
to move leadership
from the few to the many,

00:03:05.681 --> 00:03:08.100
we each need to let go of a bit of power.

00:03:09.143 --> 00:03:11.646
Now that's uncomfortable.

00:03:11.687 --> 00:03:13.981
So let's talk about how.

00:03:14.482 --> 00:03:17.693
The first thing we can do
is remove labels.

00:03:18.277 --> 00:03:21.781
Now, imagine your co-worker,
Lin, says "We need creative input."

00:03:23.032 --> 00:03:25.451
And Joe goes, "Let's ask accounting."

00:03:25.451 --> 00:03:27.662
(Laughter)

00:03:27.662 --> 00:03:29.121
Said no one, ever.

00:03:29.163 --> 00:03:30.665
(Laughter)